<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43653" root="&#xA;                        معن&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْعَنَ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He</i> (a horse) <i>went far,</i> (S, Msb, K,)
in his run. (S, Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْعَنَ فِى</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الطَّلَبِ</span>
                        <i>He went very far in search:</i> (Msb:) or
<i>he went far,</i> or <i>to a great</i> or <i>an extraordinary
length, therein.</i> (Mgh.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امعن فِى الشَّىْءِ</span>,
(Ham p. 817,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى الأَمْرِ</span>, (MA, K, Har p. 176,)
<i>He went far,</i> (K, Ham, Har,) or <i>deep,</i> or <i>beyond
bounds,</i> (MA,) <i>in,</i> or <i>into, the thing,</i> or <i>affair.</i>
(Ham, &amp;c.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْعَنَ لِى بِحَقِّى</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَذَعْنَ</span>.

